      <profiles>
        <profile name="Castellax-Achea" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Castellax-Achea | 3 | 3 | 5 | 6 | 3 | 3 | 2 | 8 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 1 Castellax-Achea
Unit Type:
• Monstrous Creature
Wargear:
• Two Dreadnought Close Combat Weapons
• Twin-linked Bolter
• Æther-fire Cannon
Special Rules:
• Fearless
• Aetheric Command Matrix
• Psychic Conduit
• Aetheric Shielding
• Thousand Sons Construct
OPTIONS
• The Maniple may include up to two additional Castellax-Achea for +130 points per model.
• Any Castellax-Achea may replace its Twin-linked Bolter with:
• Heavy Flamer ................................. +5 points
AETHERIC COMMAND MATRIX At the beginning of each Thousand Sons Movement phase, determine whether at least one model in the Maniple is within 12" of a friendly Thousand Sons Psyker. If so, the Maniple acts normally until the beginning of the next Thousand Sons Movement phase. If no friendly Thousand Sons Psyker is within 12", the Maniple must take a Leadership test. If the test is failed: • The Maniple may not Advance. • The Maniple may not charge. • If it shoots, it must target the nearest visible eligible enemy unit. PSYCHIC CONDUIT Once during each Thousand Sons Shooting phase, one friendly Thousand Sons Psyker within 12" of the Maniple may channel one psychic shooting power through one Castellax-Achea. Measure range and line of sight from the selected Castellax-Achea rather than from the Psyker. The Psyker takes the Psychic Test normally and the power counts towards the Psyker's normal psychic-power limit. The selected Castellax-Achea may not fire its Æther-fire Cannon during that Shooting phase. If the Psyker suffers Perils of the Warp while using Psychic Conduit, the selected Castellax-Achea also suffers one Wound. Its Invulnerable Save may be taken normally. AETHERIC SHIELDING The Castellax-Achea has a 5+ Invulnerable Save. This is already included in its profile. THOUSAND SONS CONSTRUCT A Castellax-Achea counts as a Thousand Sons unit for rules which specifically affect friendly Thousand Sons units. It does not possess the Legiones Astartes special rule and is not assigned to a Prosperine Cult.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r19-r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-matrix" name="Aetheric Command Matrix" hidden="false"><description>At the beginning of each Thousand Sons Movement phase, if no model in the Maniple is within 12" of a friendly Thousand Sons Psyker, take a Leadership test. If failed, the Maniple may not Advance or charge and, if it shoots, must target the nearest visible eligible enemy unit.</description></rule><rule id="r19-r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-conduit" name="Psychic Conduit" hidden="false"><description>Once in each Thousand Sons Shooting phase, one friendly Thousand Sons Psyker within 12" may channel one psychic shooting power through one Castellax-Achea, measuring range and line of sight from it. The selected Castellax may not fire its Æther-fire Cannon that phase. If the Psyker suffers Perils, the selected Castellax also suffers one Wound; its Invulnerable Save applies normally.</description></rule><rule id="r19-r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-shield" name="Aetheric Shielding" hidden="false"><description>The Castellax-Achea has a 5+ Invulnerable Save, already included in its profile.</description></rule><rule id="r19-r41-unit-xv-3-castellax-achea-maniple-construct" name="Thousand Sons Construct" hidden="false"><description>The Castellax-Achea counts as a Thousand Sons unit for rules which specifically affect friendly Thousand Sons units. It does not possess Legiones Astartes and is not assigned to a Prosperine Cult.</description></rule></rules>
